  <h2>What you do, what we do</h2>
  <p>
    You set the role and the standard. We run the ads and the screening so only people who look
    capable get through to you. You decide whether they fit your crew and whether you would trust
    them in someone’s house, because that is your company, not ours. The only thing we need from you
    is the times you can take those first calls.
  </p>
  <p>
    One thing worth knowing: the ads talk about what a good tech can earn with you. Average pay
    messaging brings average applicants. If you are willing to pay well for someone excellent, we
    say so plainly in the ad, and it changes who applies.
  </p>
